  },
  "description": "Daily Rex briefing: gathers verified signals from market intelligence, customer acquisition, contractor coverage, customer experience and operations, cross-analyzes them and stores an owner briefing with prioritized recommendations and clearly labeled forecasts. Read-only analysis; consequential actions always require owner authorization.",
  "definition": {
    "document": {
